{"mls":"R1710003","addr":"119 North 4th Street","muni":"Olean city","town":"Olean","county":"Cattaraugus","zip":"14760","ll":[42.078407,-78.435508],"status":"Active","type":"Single Family","units":1,"beds":4,"baths":2,"sqft":2098.0,"year":1900,"lot":0.117,"dom":1,"price":179900,"orig":null,"chg":"New Listing","tax":3813,"tax_mls":true,"hoa":null,"office":"Howard Hanna Professionals - Olean","phone":"716-378-7039","hhp":true,"remarks":"Charming curb appeal meets timeless character in this spacious 4-bedroom home, perfectly positioned with a welcoming front porch overlooking scenic Oak Hill Park, giving you a front-row seat to green space and neighborhood charm.\r\n\r\nStep inside through a warm, wood-accented foyer that sets the tone for what’s ahead. Gleaming hardwood floors and abundant original woodwork flow throughout much of the first floor, showcasing craftsmanship and warmth that are hard to find today. Cozy up by the gas fireplace, framed by beautifully preserved vintage tile that adds to the home’s distinctive character.\r\n\r\nThe upgraded kitchen features Italian marble flooring, Magma Gold granite countertops, a floor-heating fan, a touch-control sink faucet, a premium Thermador stove, a gourmet range hood, a stainless-steel LG refrigerator, and a spacious kitchen island with a second sink.\r\n\r\nWith four generously sized bedrooms and 1.5 baths, there’s plenty of room to spread out. Step outside onto the large back deck, ideal for entertaining or enjoying quiet evenings, overlooking a fully fenced yard with upgraded landscaping, perfect for pets, play, or gardening.\r\n\r\nAdditional highlights include a one-car attached garage and a brand-new metal roof, providing added durability and peace of mind for years to come.\r\n\r\nThis special home brings together timeless character, thoughtful upgrades, comfortable living spaces, and an exceptional location overlooking Oak Hill Park.","facts":[["Total rooms","8"],["Full baths","1"],["Half baths","1"],["Style